From 18164ef77263ffb0e73952a0755606e47edae248 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jelle van der Waa <jvanderwaa@redhat.com>
Date: Tue, 1 Sep 2026 09:40:35 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Add end-of-options markers to cockpit.spawn()

Prevent filenames/directory names being misinterpreted as command-line
options.
---
 src/dialogs/copyPasteOwnership.tsx | 3 +++
 src/dialogs/create-file.tsx        | 6 +++---
 src/dialogs/delete.tsx             | 2 +-
 src/dialogs/mkdir.tsx              | 6 +++---
 src/dialogs/permissions.tsx        | 8 ++++----
 src/dialogs/rename.tsx             | 2 +-
 src/dialogs/symlink.tsx            | 6 +++---
 src/files-breadcrumbs.tsx          | 2 +-
 src/menu.tsx                       | 1 +
 src/upload-button.tsx              | 7 ++++---
 10 files changed, 24 insertions(+), 19 deletions(-)

